{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2022-2116","published":"2022-11-25T11:05:26Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:17:26.859643793Z","upstream":["CVE-2022-31212","CVE-2022-31213"],"summary":"dbus-broker security update","details":"\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\r\n\r\nAn issue was discovered in dbus-broker before 31. It depends on c-uitl/c-shquote to parse the DBus service&apos;s Exec line. c-shquote contains a stack-based buffer over-read if a malicious Exec line is supplied.(CVE-2022-31212)\r\n\r\nAn issue was discovered in dbus-broker before 31. Multiple NULL pointer dereferences can be found when supplying a malformed XML config file.(CVE-2022-31213)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"dbus-broker","ecosystem":"openEuler:22.03-LTS","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/dbus-broker&distro=openEuler-22.03-LTS"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"29-4.oe2203"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["dbus-broker-29-4.oe2203.aarch64.rpm","dbus-broker-debuginfo-29-4.oe2203.aarch64.rpm","dbus-broker-debugsource-29-4.oe2203.aarch64.rpm"],"src":["dbus-broker-29-4.oe2203.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["dbus-broker-29-4.oe2203.x86_64.rpm","dbus-broker-debuginfo-29-4.oe2203.x86_64.rpm","dbus-broker-debugsource-29-4.oe2203.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2022-2116.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.openeuler.org/en/security/safety-bulletin/detail.html?id=openEuler-SA-2022-2116"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-31212"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-31213"}],"database_specific":{"severity":"High"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H"}]}